{{!
    @template local_reportium/schedule_step

    One step of the drill-down path of a scheduled email: the rows of a level to choose from. Rendered from
    JavaScript (local_reportium/schedule_form).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id - Id of the select
    * index - Level index (0 = level 1)
    * label - Name of the level
    * choose - Label of the empty option
    * options - [{value, label, selected}]

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "reportium-schedule-step-0",
        "index": 0,
        "label": "Courses",
        "choose": "Choose...",
        "options": [{"value": "2", "label": "Course A", "selected": true}]
    }
}}
<div class="mb-2">
    <label for="{{id}}" class="d-block small text-muted mb-1">{{label}}</label>
    <select id="{{id}}" class="custom-select form-select" data-step="{{index}}">
        <option value="">{{choose}}</option>
        {{#options}}<option value="{{value}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>{{/options}}
    </select>
</div>
